{
  "name": "lagoon",
  "label": "Lagoon",
  "description": "A JRPG island, early-2000s: a sunlit beach by day and a starlit tide after dark, with fireflies drifting up. Menus are blue gradient windows with a white edge and a pointing-glove cursor; titles are carved in Marcellus with a sea-glass sheen; keys are glossy; the featured card has a gold window frame; avatars are element orbs; progress is an overdrive gauge; the spinner is four orbs in orbit; toasts read like an item-get box; the navbar has a wave edge.",
